WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.495
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:12.765 --> 00:15.995
(Jung Yong Hwa)

3
00:16.065 --> 00:18.995
(Hong Seung Hee)

4
00:19.065 --> 00:22.305
(Lee Yi Kyung)

5
00:23.405 --> 00:25.375
(Park Yu Na)

6
00:36.655 --> 00:40.025
(Oh! My Guard)

7
00:40.085 --> 00:41.385
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

8
00:41.455 --> 00:43.055
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

9
01:05.945 --> 01:08.945
(Juan Hospital)

10
01:18.255 --> 01:22.695
Man, Director Kim chewed me out for reusing these clothes again.

11
01:22.765 --> 01:24.235
Throw this away.

12
01:24.295 --> 01:25.765
- Clean this up quickly. - Yes.

13
01:28.865 --> 01:30.535
Excuse me, are you throwing this away?

14
01:30.605 --> 01:32.275
- Pardon? - If you are throwing it away,

15
01:32.275 --> 01:33.575
could I wear it...

16
01:33.645 --> 01:35.045
Sure, go ahead.

17
01:35.105 --> 01:36.105
Thank you.

18
01:39.485 --> 01:40.515
Hey!

19
01:47.985 --> 01:49.795
Get him.

20
01:49.855 --> 01:52.355
We are in front of a hospital. Did no one teach you any manners?

21
01:52.425 --> 01:54.295
Keep the weapons in the factory.

22
01:55.725 --> 01:58.065
Hey, get him. I said get him.

23
01:59.565 --> 02:00.565
What?

24
02:01.605 --> 02:02.605
Where did my ring go?

25
02:04.605 --> 02:08.275
That is what you get for smashing my guys with your own hands. Get him.

26
02:08.345 --> 02:10.015
Wait.

27
02:10.075 --> 02:11.815
- Where did it go? - Why is he getting up? Why?

28
02:13.145 --> 02:14.145
What is wrong with him?

29
02:14.215 --> 02:15.615
(Juan Hospital)

30
02:15.685 --> 02:18.285
- Get him. - No, I mean...

31
02:18.355 --> 02:20.125
Where did it go?

32
02:20.185 --> 02:22.625
- Are you kidding me? Hey. Get him. - Son of a...

33
02:22.685 --> 02:24.355
Hey, get him. Hey, hold still. Stay right there.

34
02:24.425 --> 02:25.425
Come here.

35
02:41.205 --> 02:42.205
I told you, right?

36
02:44.145 --> 02:45.145
That I would always...

37
02:47.045 --> 02:48.185
protect you.

38
02:51.985 --> 02:55.785
Cut. What is going on? Hey. Who are you? Darn it.

39
02:57.255 --> 02:59.825
Who are you? Can you not see we are filming?

40
02:59.895 --> 03:03.995
Who do you think you are, barging onto my set and ruining everything?

41
03:04.065 --> 03:05.565
What is he saying?

42
03:05.635 --> 03:07.535
Hey, are you okay? Your hands? Your head?

43
03:07.605 --> 03:08.965
Is everything intact?

44
03:09.035 --> 03:13.045
- Who are you? - Hey, is she someone you know?

45
03:13.105 --> 03:14.375
No, she is not.

46
03:14.445 --> 03:15.445
Did you hurt your head?

47
03:15.505 --> 03:18.515
I told you, right? Never go around alone.

48
03:18.575 --> 03:22.185
You cannot even eat alone. You might get attacked like earlier.

49
03:22.245 --> 03:23.855
When did I get attacked?

50
03:27.985 --> 03:29.255
- Wait. - What is wrong with you?

51
03:29.325 --> 03:31.355
Have we met before...

52
03:32.795 --> 03:35.395
I have definitely seen those eyes before.

53
03:37.595 --> 03:40.165
What do you mean, seen those eyes before?

54
03:40.235 --> 03:43.205
You see this face every day, so why would only these eyes be unfamiliar?

55
03:43.275 --> 03:46.675
Did you just hit me? Are you crazy? What is your deal? Who are you?

56
03:46.745 --> 03:48.605
What is wrong with you? Are you asking without knowing?

57
03:48.675 --> 03:49.675
I know your secret...

58
03:54.145 --> 03:56.655
How many times do I tell you? Ears were made to hold glasses...

59
03:56.715 --> 03:58.155
What? What did you do with your glasses?

60
03:59.725 --> 04:02.825
Whatever. It is dangerous to go around alone.

61
04:02.885 --> 04:05.395
What will you do if you get threatened again?

62
04:05.455 --> 04:07.065
Threatened? Is she an anti-fan?

63
04:12.095 --> 04:13.905
Okay, okay.

64
04:13.905 --> 04:17.305
I see. So,

65
04:17.375 --> 04:19.305
you are a die-hard fan of mine.

66
04:19.375 --> 04:20.975
You saw the action scene and got worried.

67
04:21.045 --> 04:23.115
Always worrying if I will get sick or hurt,

68
04:23.175 --> 04:25.545
my dedicated fan club.

69
04:26.945 --> 04:28.215
Pathetic Um-ppo?

70
04:29.755 --> 04:31.555
Gosh, what is he talking about?

71
04:31.615 --> 04:33.185
Look at me, are you sure you are not hurt anywhere?

72
04:35.055 --> 04:36.525
What is going on here?

73
04:36.595 --> 04:38.325
Are those two in some sort of relationship?

74
04:38.395 --> 04:40.095
What? No, they are not.

75
04:40.165 --> 04:42.895
Then why did she come to my set? What in the world?

76
04:42.965 --> 04:45.335
Is that not the costume we use for our shoot?

77
04:45.395 --> 04:49.035
Who gave them permission to wear it? Hey.

78
04:49.105 --> 04:50.275
Take that off of them right now.

79
04:50.335 --> 04:51.805
- What? - Strip it all off.

80
04:51.875 --> 04:52.875
Wait a minute.

81
04:52.935 --> 04:54.045
Drag them out and take it off right now.

82
04:54.105 --> 04:55.105
I will not take it off.

83
04:55.105 --> 04:56.575
- I cannot take it off. - Drag them out.

84
04:59.275 --> 05:00.285
What is going on?

85
05:05.415 --> 05:07.555
(Oh! My Guard)

86
05:07.625 --> 05:10.125
(Episode 2)

87
05:11.595 --> 05:13.625
What was up with that girl earlier?

88
05:13.695 --> 05:16.225
What kind of fan is that aggressive?

89
05:16.295 --> 05:18.565
I have definitely seen her somewhere.

90
05:22.835 --> 05:25.205
That extra.

91
05:26.305 --> 05:28.075
Then...

92
05:28.145 --> 05:30.675
Does that woman have my ring?

93
05:36.115 --> 05:37.815
Good thing there were more clothes to toss.

94
05:37.815 --> 05:39.215
I was almost in big trouble.

95
05:40.585 --> 05:42.985
Oh man, but where did he run off to in the meantime?

96
05:44.955 --> 05:47.895
Still, it is a relief. He does not seem to be hurt anywhere.

97
05:53.465 --> 05:55.605
Actually, when the time of death was pronounced,

98
05:55.665 --> 05:58.935
I think I saw the patient's hand move for a moment.

99
06:00.005 --> 06:01.005
I am sorry.

100
06:01.075 --> 06:02.745
Excuse me, please take a look at this.

101
06:08.045 --> 06:09.085
The young lady is really alive.

102
06:13.085 --> 06:14.255
She is perfectly alive and well.

103
06:14.325 --> 06:16.225
I checked the security cameras myself.

104
06:20.195 --> 06:22.395
You should file a missing person report right away.

105
06:22.465 --> 06:24.865
We cannot do that. Find Hae Ra quietly.

106
06:29.405 --> 06:31.505
The new director coming to the Strategic Planning Team tomorrow.

107
06:31.575 --> 06:34.475
An exceptional recruitment the board agreed upon.

108
06:34.545 --> 06:37.145
Whether we use him as an ally or drive him out as an enemy,

109
06:37.215 --> 06:39.745
well, we will find out soon enough.

110
06:39.815 --> 06:40.815
You may leave.

111
06:54.595 --> 06:56.765
Oh, it is cold.

112
06:56.835 --> 07:00.465
Han Jung Woo, you really want to end up in a coffin, do you not?

113
07:00.535 --> 07:02.735
Just wait until I catch you.

114
07:02.805 --> 07:05.975
No. I should barge in right now and just...

115
07:06.035 --> 07:07.405
Wait.

116
07:07.475 --> 07:08.875
Where was Han Jung Woo's house again?

117
07:10.075 --> 07:11.415
His phone number?

118
07:11.475 --> 07:13.945
More importantly, why did I do that at the hospital earlier...

119
07:31.195 --> 07:33.205
What? Why are the brakes acting like this?

120
07:34.205 --> 07:35.635
What?

121
07:35.705 --> 07:37.135
Did someone do this on purpose again...

122
07:37.205 --> 07:38.275
Are we going to die now?

123
07:39.275 --> 07:40.645
Who says we are going to die?

124
07:40.705 --> 07:43.005
You are overestimating the top speed of a scooter.

125
07:43.075 --> 07:44.875
Because I only ever ride in cars with the highest top speeds.

126
07:44.945 --> 07:47.115
Then why did that amazing car of yours break down?

127
07:47.185 --> 07:50.385
I promise you. You are absolutely not going to die today.

128
07:50.455 --> 07:52.355
Now I am going to crash into that street tree and stop.

129
07:52.415 --> 07:53.425
You trust me, right?

130
08:02.165 --> 08:06.135
So that is why I woke up at the hospital back then.

131
08:07.435 --> 08:09.665
But why did Han Jung Woo run away earlier?

132
08:11.475 --> 08:14.945
Whatever. Let me just find that jerk's house first.

133
08:18.045 --> 08:20.615
But why can I not remember anything?

134
08:41.835 --> 08:43.005
I am starving to death.

135
08:45.105 --> 08:46.105
What?

136
08:50.145 --> 08:51.575
Yes.

137
08:55.885 --> 08:57.655
This woman looks perfectly normal,

138
08:57.715 --> 08:58.815
but are you trying to scam me right now?

139
08:59.815 --> 09:01.225
(10 Dollars)

140
09:01.285 --> 09:02.955
(Free Dried Snacks With Alcohol Orders)

141
09:04.695 --> 09:08.225
Oh my, since when did this face on the bill...

142
09:08.295 --> 09:11.735
start smiling so much?

143
09:11.795 --> 09:14.335
These fakes are rolling around all over the streets everywhere.

144
09:14.405 --> 09:17.335
This cannot be your first time. I will report the dine-and-dash,

145
09:17.405 --> 09:19.175
so let us see if you can still say that in front of the police.

146
09:19.235 --> 09:21.475
- What? - How much is everything she ate?

147
09:28.415 --> 09:30.585
(Come Again Dumplings)

148
09:30.655 --> 09:33.215
Oh, I guess all the strange things that happened today...

149
09:33.285 --> 09:35.925
were just leading up to me meeting a savior like you.

150
09:37.095 --> 09:39.995
But since you are helping me, could you spare ten more dollars...

151
09:44.735 --> 09:46.565
Then what are you going to give me?

152
09:47.835 --> 09:49.705
You have not shown any honesty or remorse,

153
09:49.765 --> 09:50.835
so I doubt you can give me those.

154
09:52.175 --> 09:53.805
Oh, I really thought it was real money...

155
09:55.875 --> 09:58.445
Wow, you are treating me like a...

156
10:00.845 --> 10:02.745
For your kindness today,

157
10:02.745 --> 10:08.785
I will definitely repay you when we meet again someday.

158
10:08.855 --> 10:11.455
Well then, goodbye.

159
10:18.895 --> 10:21.565
Oh, man. I almost stepped on it.

160
10:25.605 --> 10:27.205
Flowers bloom even in places like this.

161
10:39.685 --> 10:43.525
Now, this is your Iron Man suit.

162
10:49.465 --> 10:50.535
Excuse me, wait a minute.

163
10:57.075 --> 11:00.245
Leave something with me instead. Like collateral?

164
11:03.515 --> 11:06.075
- That ring should do. - I do not wear rings...

165
11:08.245 --> 11:10.285
I am wearing one. A ring?

166
11:10.355 --> 11:13.425
I was so busy eating earlier that I did not know I had this.

167
11:13.485 --> 11:15.525
Why? Is there a problem?

168
11:23.195 --> 11:25.035
Is this the American style?

169
11:25.095 --> 11:27.135
You have a strong sense of give and take.

170
11:29.965 --> 11:31.035
British style.

171
11:33.035 --> 11:34.275
I just got back from the United Kingdom today.

172
11:39.715 --> 11:40.715
By the way,

173
11:41.885 --> 11:42.885
did you run away from home?

174
11:44.755 --> 11:48.185
Well, I feel more like becoming a monk than running away.

175
11:48.255 --> 11:49.985
My employer suddenly ignored me...

176
11:51.995 --> 11:54.995
Oh, I was a live-in bodyguard.

177
11:55.065 --> 11:57.565
Anyway, I have to go find that guy's house now, so...

178
12:00.435 --> 12:03.635
Then you can get this ring back here at this time tomorrow.

179
12:04.805 --> 12:06.275
Yes, see you.

180
12:13.585 --> 12:15.545
I just said that, but she actually left it.

181
12:16.885 --> 12:18.955
Is there a sauna around here...

182
12:24.755 --> 12:25.755
This way.

183
12:31.295 --> 12:32.295
What about over there?

184
12:33.735 --> 12:34.765
Keep looking.

185
12:39.975 --> 12:41.505
I do not think I walked that much,

186
12:41.575 --> 12:45.215
but why do I feel like I am losing muscle mass?

187
12:54.855 --> 12:55.985
(Waiting Line)

188
12:56.055 --> 12:57.195
Come here, stand right there.

189
12:57.255 --> 12:58.925
Keep your buttocks tight and stand still.

190
12:58.995 --> 13:00.025
If you let your guard down for a second,

191
13:00.095 --> 13:01.565
it is two laps around the parade ground.

192
13:04.235 --> 13:06.165
Am I right?

193
13:06.235 --> 13:09.765
V? Or Jung Kook?

194
13:09.835 --> 13:11.775
I am...

195
13:11.835 --> 13:15.875
Rolling Park Ji Min. What do I do?

196
13:15.945 --> 13:19.175
God, Buddha, ancestors. Please help me...

197
13:19.245 --> 13:21.615
get my hands on BTS's new album.

198
13:22.745 --> 13:24.585
Why do you have that look on your face?

199
13:24.655 --> 13:27.655
Are you not an Army? I purple you.

200
13:29.125 --> 13:30.255
I am not.

201
13:32.295 --> 13:33.725
But this is really fascinating.

202
13:33.795 --> 13:35.295
I have only seen this kind of thing on television.

203
13:35.365 --> 13:39.165
Fascinating, right? Yes, it is. I find you more fascinating.

204
13:40.165 --> 13:41.805
Have you never fangirled over an idol?

205
13:44.175 --> 13:45.205
What about an actor?

206
13:47.705 --> 13:51.475
You, what do you live for?

207
13:51.545 --> 13:52.675
Sit down here.

208
13:55.315 --> 13:57.315
(Waiting Line)

209
14:00.925 --> 14:03.025
First of all, as for actors,

210
14:04.095 --> 14:07.865
Um Tae Bong is my absolute favorite.

211
14:07.925 --> 14:11.335
Even though he has been breaking my heart a little lately.

212
14:12.835 --> 14:15.265
Um Tae Bong? What about him?

213
14:15.335 --> 14:17.905
He got caught up in another dating rumor.

214
14:17.975 --> 14:19.735
I wonder how long this one will last.

215
14:19.805 --> 14:22.345
Anyway, it is quite a mystery.

216
14:24.345 --> 14:27.115
Look. This Um Tae Bong...

217
14:27.185 --> 14:29.545
never shoots kiss scenes, you know.

218
14:29.615 --> 14:32.055
Whether it is out of loyalty to his real girlfriend...

219
14:32.115 --> 14:34.355
or if there is some other reason.

220
14:42.395 --> 14:45.195
But why are you wandering around so late at night?

221
14:46.735 --> 14:48.005
To catch some guy.

222
14:48.065 --> 14:51.235
I cannot remember where that jerk lives,

223
14:51.305 --> 14:53.905
but I do remember his company.

224
14:53.975 --> 14:57.415
It was a car company that started with a B or something.

225
14:58.675 --> 15:00.815
That would be BK Motors.

226
15:00.885 --> 15:02.145
The really big building.

227
15:03.415 --> 15:05.715
BK Motors.

228
15:05.785 --> 15:06.885
(BK Motor Group)

229
15:16.295 --> 15:17.665
Look at the state of you.

230
15:18.935 --> 15:22.005
- What department are you even in? - My luggage has not arrived yet.

231
15:22.065 --> 15:24.475
- Is it your first day? - Yes.

232
15:24.535 --> 15:26.035
Newbies these days have no discipline.

233
15:29.145 --> 15:32.875
I am Na Dae Seong, the real power of the Strategic Planning Team.

234
15:32.945 --> 15:33.945
Right, I am...

235
15:34.015 --> 15:36.545
Anyway, stay out of our director's sight.

236
15:36.615 --> 15:39.255
He is the type to judge the hierarchy by how you dress,

237
15:39.315 --> 15:42.725
and he values team unity. Got it?

238
15:42.785 --> 15:43.795
Right.

239
15:49.725 --> 15:50.735
What are you doing?

240
15:52.065 --> 15:53.065
Follow me.

241
15:54.235 --> 15:56.805
- Good morning. - Good morning.

242
15:58.375 --> 15:59.835
- Hi. - Director, you are here?

243
16:00.945 --> 16:01.945
Yes.

244
16:03.075 --> 16:05.675
Everyone, our new director is here.

245
16:05.745 --> 16:08.445
I look forward to working with you. I am Director Han Jung Woo.

246
16:08.515 --> 16:09.515
What?

247
16:09.585 --> 16:10.815
We look forward to working with you, Director Han.

248
16:10.885 --> 16:12.555
(Strategic Planning Team)

249
16:14.385 --> 16:16.885
So, could someone give me an update on today's...

250
16:18.595 --> 16:19.825
Last year's BK business status report,

251
16:19.895 --> 16:20.895
the statement of financial position,

252
16:20.965 --> 16:23.065
and the list of candidates for the new model being released.

253
16:23.125 --> 16:25.895
I stayed up all night preparing every single word.

254
16:25.965 --> 16:28.335
My esteemed Director Han.

255
16:28.405 --> 16:29.405
Thank you.

256
16:30.775 --> 16:31.775
Thanks to you, I also learned about...

257
16:31.835 --> 16:33.535
my own fashion philosophy that I was unaware of.

258
16:34.645 --> 16:37.075
- Where is my office? - It is right this way.

259
16:37.145 --> 16:39.615
Welcome.

260
16:42.085 --> 16:43.445
The actor who got hurt yesterday...

261
16:43.515 --> 16:44.615
is throwing a fit and threatening to sue.

262
16:44.685 --> 16:46.955
He claims you and your fan conspired to beat him up.

263
16:47.015 --> 16:48.955
He is demanding you bring her to apologize.

264
16:49.025 --> 16:51.225
Who is this fan? What kind of fan is she?

265
16:51.295 --> 16:55.225
That works out well. I needed to find that woman anyway.

266
17:02.405 --> 17:04.775
(Juan Hospital)

267
17:09.445 --> 17:10.575
Where is she?

268
17:15.845 --> 17:16.845
Tae Bong.

269
17:18.185 --> 17:19.455
Are you looking for someone?

270
17:19.515 --> 17:21.785
The girl who almost stood in for Song Na Ri yesterday.

271
17:21.855 --> 17:23.125
Did she come in today?

272
17:23.185 --> 17:24.195
Yes.

273
17:25.555 --> 17:26.725
That is her over there.

274
17:32.335 --> 17:34.805
You Pathetic Um-ppo, give me my ring back.

275
17:38.275 --> 17:40.605
It is not her. I am sorry.

276
17:46.315 --> 17:47.915
Tae Bong.

277
17:47.985 --> 17:49.815
We are done filming, are you not leaving?

278
17:49.885 --> 17:52.055
I need you to find someone.

279
17:52.115 --> 17:54.585
She got all upset because we did not wake her up that day,

280
17:54.655 --> 17:55.785
stormed onto the set,

281
17:55.855 --> 17:57.895
and told a man she had never met that she would protect him...

282
17:57.955 --> 17:59.425
while touching him all over.

283
18:00.725 --> 18:03.495
How much more detail do you need? She was just...

284
18:04.595 --> 18:06.895
kind of pretty?

285
18:08.665 --> 18:10.365
I have not seen anyone like that,

286
18:10.435 --> 18:13.305
but a face that makes a man want to run away...

287
18:13.375 --> 18:14.805
is coming right over there.

288
18:17.615 --> 18:20.815
Tae Bong.

289
18:28.625 --> 18:31.625
You. Did your CEO not tell you?

290
18:31.695 --> 18:32.925
We are in a fake relationship...

291
18:35.295 --> 18:38.295
- Darn it, he did not. - Why did you ignore my messages?

292
18:38.365 --> 18:39.435
Did you not miss me?

293
18:39.495 --> 18:40.505
Do I not look like I lost some weight?

294
18:40.565 --> 18:42.805
More importantly, I have something to ask you.

295
18:43.805 --> 18:45.535
A stranger's body...

296
18:45.605 --> 18:48.345
Well, technically not a stranger.

297
18:49.675 --> 18:53.645
She probably saw him on TV. But she groped him...

298
18:53.715 --> 18:56.185
the first time they met in person.

299
18:56.245 --> 18:58.955
- What kind of woman is that? - Is she pretty?

300
18:59.015 --> 19:00.855
You could say that.

301
19:00.925 --> 19:05.255
Hey, that is not the point. What kind of woman does that,

302
19:05.325 --> 19:08.625
what goes through her head, and where does she usually hang out?

303
19:09.895 --> 19:12.495
Well, if she is pretty, her brain probably works like mine.

304
19:12.565 --> 19:15.105
But that is weird. We usually make men desperate...

305
19:15.165 --> 19:18.275
to touch us. We do not touch them first.

306
19:20.975 --> 19:23.605
Na Ri, we are ready for your solo scene.

307
19:23.675 --> 19:24.675
Okay.

308
19:26.345 --> 19:29.445
Do not leave, wait for me. Let us go on a date after this.

309
19:32.915 --> 19:35.255
She is quite the specimen.

310
19:37.495 --> 19:38.955
Anyway,

311
19:39.025 --> 19:40.825
where on earth am I supposed to find that girl?

312
19:47.135 --> 19:48.465
What is this?

313
19:49.805 --> 19:51.505
What is going on?

314
19:51.575 --> 19:53.135
Did everyone leave?

315
19:54.275 --> 19:55.475
The kids are gone,

316
19:55.545 --> 19:58.045
and my BTS album is gone too.

317
19:58.115 --> 20:01.585
How could they? Those cheap bastards.

318
20:01.645 --> 20:03.485
They could have at least woken me up.

319
20:05.185 --> 20:06.385
How could they...

320
20:10.525 --> 20:12.055
What is this?

321
20:12.125 --> 20:13.255
Did you not leave?

322
20:14.495 --> 20:16.025
Wow, you are loyal.

323
20:17.265 --> 20:20.705
If you ever need to find a room,

324
20:20.765 --> 20:21.765
come see me.

325
20:21.835 --> 20:23.135
(Jal Real Estate Park Mi Hyang)

326
20:23.205 --> 20:25.105
Seeing you in the daylight,

327
20:25.175 --> 20:26.575
you look like a mess...

328
20:32.815 --> 20:35.085
- Why are you ordering me around? - Tae Bong.

329
20:36.615 --> 20:37.615
We...

330
20:42.125 --> 20:44.125
- We got a commercial offer. - Oh, my.

331
20:44.195 --> 20:46.855
It seems our CEO Park has no one to play with.

332
20:46.925 --> 20:49.065
Making such a fuss over one commercial.

333
20:51.265 --> 20:54.235
BK Motors.

334
20:59.035 --> 21:01.205
The commercial you wanted to shoot.

335
21:05.345 --> 21:08.415
I understand. Darn it, it is too good to miss.

336
21:11.785 --> 21:14.025
Really? Did Messi not renew his contract?

337
21:14.085 --> 21:15.955
Or do I have to pay the modeling fee to shoot it?

338
21:17.285 --> 21:21.565
- That would really break my heart. - But they say there is a condition.

339
21:21.625 --> 21:23.865
It seems the new director is pushing for you.

340
21:23.925 --> 21:25.365
Let us go, before they change their mind.

341
21:25.435 --> 21:27.865
What should I wear? Is the director a woman or a man?

342
21:27.935 --> 21:29.935
If it is a woman, I will go with a sexy concept,

343
21:31.275 --> 21:32.275
and if it is a man...

344
21:40.745 --> 21:43.185
Who is this endless sexy concept...

345
21:43.245 --> 21:47.215
- even for? - It is for men, of course.

346
21:47.285 --> 21:50.125
In a battle of nerves between two males, you must absolutely...

347
21:50.185 --> 21:51.955
push forward with sexiness.

348
21:53.195 --> 21:56.465
Why did he ask to meet in person? Oh, boy.

349
21:56.525 --> 21:59.235
We have to dress at least this well so we do not fall behind.

350
21:59.295 --> 22:02.465
It was hard getting this on such short notice.

351
22:02.535 --> 22:04.605
Yes, you saved me.

352
22:04.675 --> 22:06.975
- Let us go. - Yes, thank you.

353
22:07.035 --> 22:10.005
(BK Motor Group)

354
22:15.085 --> 22:16.815
You are as handsome as I have heard.

355
22:16.885 --> 22:19.885
My charm is a one-way street, so there is no exit.

356
22:19.955 --> 22:21.055
There is an entrance, though.

357
22:23.885 --> 22:26.425
They call you the master of romance who does not shoot kiss scenes.

358
22:26.495 --> 22:28.025
May I ask what the reason is?

359
22:32.565 --> 22:34.435
If it were you...

360
22:34.505 --> 22:37.105
would you reveal a top-secret business strategy?

361
22:41.275 --> 22:44.945
I almost said that. Because you came on so strong.

362
22:45.015 --> 22:46.515
Is he trying...

363
22:46.575 --> 22:48.415
to dominate the conversation?

364
22:48.485 --> 22:49.885
Yes, I am.

365
22:58.995 --> 23:00.995
Our goal is Sexy...

366
23:02.395 --> 23:03.925
Trash.

367
23:03.995 --> 23:06.165
- You have heard that a lot, right? - Trash?

368
23:06.235 --> 23:09.435
I like that trash image. How much must they want it...

369
23:09.505 --> 23:11.435
to express it so paradoxically?

370
23:13.435 --> 23:15.445
Is this a compliment?

371
23:15.505 --> 23:17.545
Maybe it is not a paradoxical expression?

372
23:17.615 --> 23:19.175
Maybe he means actual trash.

373
23:21.645 --> 23:22.845
The new car coming out this time...

374
23:22.915 --> 23:25.785
will be for those who recognize its value.

375
23:25.855 --> 23:27.625
We have no intention of targeting all consumers...

376
23:27.685 --> 23:30.385
with just comfort and convenience.

377
23:30.455 --> 23:32.155
Even if we get criticized, we will not compromise...

378
23:32.225 --> 23:34.365
on the ultimate beauty and our brand.

379
23:34.425 --> 23:37.835
- That is our strategy. - Even if I am called trash,

380
23:37.895 --> 23:40.595
I will not compromise on the ultimate sexiness.

381
23:40.665 --> 23:43.905
So, while you are our model, Um Tae Bong,

382
23:43.965 --> 23:47.845
you must maintain that Sexy Trash image.

383
23:47.905 --> 23:49.075
This is our condition.

384
23:50.745 --> 23:52.075
Well, his daily life is trash,

385
23:52.145 --> 23:54.415
so you absolutely do not need to worry about that.

386
23:56.585 --> 23:58.715
I also have a condition.

387
23:58.785 --> 24:00.955
I am constitutionally incapable of lying,

388
24:01.025 --> 24:04.255
so I want to see for myself...

389
24:04.325 --> 24:06.555
if it is truly worth that much.

390
24:06.625 --> 24:08.495
Hey, what is wrong with you?

391
24:08.565 --> 24:10.995
You look like a celebrity who is just after freebies.

392
24:11.065 --> 24:13.335
Why? I like free things.

393
24:18.675 --> 24:21.075
(BK Motor Group)

394
24:23.045 --> 24:24.075
Okay, deal.

395
24:54.275 --> 24:55.275
How many times do I have to tell you?

396
24:55.345 --> 24:56.805
You cannot go in without an appointment.

397
24:56.875 --> 24:58.845
I am telling you, I really work here.

398
24:58.915 --> 25:00.775
I am that jerk Han Jung Woo's...

399
25:02.785 --> 25:04.915
Oh, I really cannot even say this...

400
25:08.255 --> 25:09.255
Seriously, why are you being like this?

401
25:09.325 --> 25:12.195
Oh, seriously, just this once, okay? Just once, okay?

402
25:12.255 --> 25:14.325
What? There he comes.

403
25:16.665 --> 25:17.665
We will send the new car soon.

404
25:17.735 --> 25:19.235
Is that the person you are looking for?

405
25:19.295 --> 25:20.395
I will share my thoughts...

406
25:20.395 --> 25:22.605
- on the test drive soon, too. - Yes, that is him.

407
25:26.535 --> 25:28.445
- Are you ready, sir? - Yes.

408
25:28.505 --> 25:31.245
Great work. We will depart immediately.

409
25:42.355 --> 25:44.795
Get home safely, okay? Sir.

410
25:44.855 --> 25:46.025
Please follow that car.

411
26:04.445 --> 26:05.575
What's wrong with me?

412
26:12.815 --> 26:14.725
What are you going to do if rumors spread...

413
26:14.785 --> 26:16.555
that a celebrity is demanding freebies?

414
26:16.625 --> 26:17.925
Is it erased?

415
26:17.995 --> 26:19.325
Yes, here, put this on.

416
26:21.065 --> 26:22.965
Seriously, Tae Bong, why did you do that earlier?

417
26:23.025 --> 26:25.935
- You absolutely hate looking cheap. - That director guy,

418
26:25.995 --> 26:27.965
I did not like him from the moment I saw his face.

419
26:28.035 --> 26:30.805
Why? Because he is as handsome as you? No, but what if...

420
26:30.865 --> 26:33.375
an article says Um Tae Bong demanded a 100K car for free?

421
26:33.435 --> 26:35.775
They asked me to live as Sexy Trash.

422
26:35.845 --> 26:38.515
Right. For the rest of your life?

423
26:38.575 --> 26:42.145
Live as this Sexy Trash. Man, seriously.

424
26:42.215 --> 26:45.285
Take the exact price of that new car we received...

425
26:45.355 --> 26:46.855
and donate it secretly.

426
26:50.155 --> 26:52.095
Gosh...

427
26:52.155 --> 26:54.795
You are just a sexy guy.

428
26:54.865 --> 26:57.865
That guy Um Tae Bong is a bit unpredictable, but...

429
26:57.935 --> 26:59.265
he was quite charming.

430
27:00.865 --> 27:03.635
That is how I felt when I first saw you in London, Director Han.

431
27:04.705 --> 27:08.245
For this new car promotion, take full charge of it.

432
27:08.305 --> 27:09.305
Yes, sir.

433
27:12.515 --> 27:13.915
By the way,

434
27:13.975 --> 27:18.455
did you happen to meet anyone else in London besides me?

435
27:20.085 --> 27:22.425
Right, we will talk more later.

436
27:22.485 --> 27:23.485
Yes, sir.

437
27:35.765 --> 27:37.105
We still do not know the young lady's whereabouts...

438
27:41.075 --> 27:44.345
Set up the gym for me. I am going to settle things today...

439
27:44.415 --> 27:45.545
and put Dong Seok in that position.

440
27:45.615 --> 27:47.675
Understood. Hey, but...

441
27:47.745 --> 27:49.145
we could not find the female fan. What should we do?

442
27:49.215 --> 27:51.615
They said they would only meet us if we bring the victim.

443
27:51.685 --> 27:53.785
Keep looking.

444
27:53.855 --> 27:55.155
By the way,

445
27:55.225 --> 27:57.355
Song Na Ri's CEO is not doing his job properly, is he?

446
27:57.425 --> 27:59.155
Why am I her honey?

447
27:59.225 --> 28:01.565
CEO Lee said he clearly told her it was a contract relationship.

448
28:01.625 --> 28:03.665
But is Song Na Ri a bit crazy?

449
28:03.725 --> 28:06.065
She is acting like that because she wants to date you this time.

450
28:06.135 --> 28:08.935
Honestly, you should just date her. A girl like Song Na Ri is a catch.

451
28:09.005 --> 28:11.905
- Honey. - You fix this.

452
28:11.975 --> 28:13.105
You startled me, man.

453
28:14.335 --> 28:16.045
I...

454
28:16.105 --> 28:19.075
- There is a woman I like. - What?

455
28:19.145 --> 28:21.685
What did you just say? What?

456
28:21.745 --> 28:24.985
What woman? What? Hey.

457
28:25.055 --> 28:28.225
Hey, what woman do you like?

458
28:28.285 --> 28:30.255
What woman?

459
28:30.325 --> 28:32.125
What is he talking about?

460
28:40.665 --> 28:43.335
- Knock, knock. - Yes.

461
28:43.405 --> 28:44.605
Water, water.

462
28:46.075 --> 28:47.105
Hey...

463
28:50.905 --> 28:53.275
What? You.

464
28:54.315 --> 28:57.345
Wow, I almost died. Do I get carsick?

465
28:57.415 --> 28:59.285
- Since when? - How would I know that?

466
28:59.355 --> 29:00.855
If you do not know, who does?

467
29:04.725 --> 29:07.495
Anyway, that is a relief. I was looking for you.

468
29:07.555 --> 29:09.165
You need to talk to me.

469
29:09.225 --> 29:10.595
Excuse me...

470
29:10.665 --> 29:12.695
Can we eat something first?

471
29:16.505 --> 29:18.375
(Taking a Short Break)

472
29:19.875 --> 29:21.905
This is the most delicious food I have ever had in my life.

473
29:21.975 --> 29:22.975
Now, now.

474
29:23.045 --> 29:25.515
- Give me my ring back. - Oh that...

475
29:25.575 --> 29:27.015
So that ring was yours?

476
29:27.075 --> 29:30.015
- But why was it on my finger? - That is because...

477
29:30.085 --> 29:31.085
even though I was right next to you,

478
29:31.155 --> 29:33.855
you were in such a deep sleep that you did not notice.

479
29:35.785 --> 29:37.855
While I was sleeping,

480
29:37.925 --> 29:41.565
- what were you doing? - Hey, what do you mean?

481
29:41.625 --> 29:44.125
I put the ring on your finger...

482
29:44.195 --> 29:45.995
and rehearsed, rehearsed.

483
29:48.065 --> 29:52.075
Anyway, it is important to me. I was going to give it...

484
29:52.135 --> 29:53.805
to the first person I ever wanted.

485
29:53.875 --> 29:57.445
So, Pathetic Um-ppo, give me my ring.

486
29:57.505 --> 29:58.645
You said that last time too.

487
29:58.715 --> 30:02.085
- Um-ppo? What is that? - "Um-ppo, what is that?"

488
30:02.145 --> 30:03.945
You do not know what Pathetic Um-ppo is?

489
30:06.255 --> 30:08.085
You,

490
30:08.155 --> 30:09.855
what exactly is your identity?

491
30:16.295 --> 30:20.495
I am a bodyguard. Yes, a secret bodyguard.

492
30:20.565 --> 30:23.835
Cha Hong Du.

493
30:23.905 --> 30:26.335
- Who decided that? - You asked me to.

494
30:26.405 --> 30:28.945
- Do you really not remember? - How are you feeling?

495
30:35.515 --> 30:36.785
My head was smashed with a flowerpot...

496
30:36.845 --> 30:39.355
it would be weirder if I were fine.

497
30:39.415 --> 30:41.115
No, how many times has it been...

498
30:43.385 --> 30:45.525
You said you think you know who the blackmailer is, right?

499
30:45.595 --> 30:49.395
So about that, how about becoming my bodyguard?

500
30:49.465 --> 30:51.395
I need to trick the shareholders.

501
30:51.465 --> 30:54.805
A woman who does not look like a bodyguard would be perfect.

502
30:54.865 --> 30:57.205
Who says I do not look like a bodyguard?

503
30:57.265 --> 31:01.135
I totally have the bodyguard vibe.

504
31:01.205 --> 31:03.005
I will pay you whatever salary you want.

505
31:03.075 --> 31:05.575
You start the day you leave the hospital.

506
31:05.645 --> 31:08.215
I'm all better. I'll start right away.

507
31:12.085 --> 31:13.155
Is she a doctor or something?

508
31:13.215 --> 31:15.455
Taking off her bandages however she wants.

509
31:15.525 --> 31:17.955
Creepy. How do I know this?

510
31:18.025 --> 31:19.695
Are you still going to ignore me?

511
31:21.595 --> 31:23.295
Man, but...

512
31:23.365 --> 31:26.265
What kind of woman is the owner of that ring?

513
31:26.335 --> 31:27.565
Is she pretty?

514
31:27.635 --> 31:29.605
Gosh. Let's talk outside.

515
31:29.665 --> 31:31.165
You're done eating, right? Hurry up and come out.

516
31:31.235 --> 31:34.505
- Come out. - Hey, I asked if she's pretty.

517
31:40.075 --> 31:42.785
I feel like I've seen something similar somewhere...

518
31:42.845 --> 31:44.115
Did I hear it from Tae Bong?

519
31:53.655 --> 31:55.495
Hey, it's me.

520
31:55.565 --> 31:57.125
Yes.

521
31:57.195 --> 31:59.295
Oh, right, there was a scene like that, wasn't there?

522
31:59.365 --> 32:01.635
Wow, you have a good memory.

523
32:02.235 --> 32:05.475
So there really is a scene like that?

524
32:05.535 --> 32:07.375
That's from The Crown Prince's Bodyguard.

525
32:07.435 --> 32:08.675
It was Um Tae Bong's first leading role...

526
32:08.745 --> 32:10.845
and his first project with me. But why?

527
32:10.845 --> 32:14.345
I just suddenly thought of it.

528
32:14.415 --> 32:17.345
It was a romance between an heir and a female bodyguard,

529
32:17.415 --> 32:19.885
and it was the only sad ending among my dramas.

530
32:19.955 --> 32:22.485
Even you remember all those gem-like scenes,

531
32:22.555 --> 32:25.255
but Um Tae Bong, the lead, has probably forgotten them all.

532
32:25.325 --> 32:26.895
It's really fascinating.

533
32:26.955 --> 32:29.995
He's the type to completely empty his head once filming is over.

534
32:36.605 --> 32:39.375
I'm telling you again, you're not my bodyguard,

535
32:39.435 --> 32:41.475
and I never hired you.

536
32:42.875 --> 32:45.545
But what was that memory from earlier?

537
32:45.615 --> 32:47.215
Was it a scene I acted in?

538
32:48.715 --> 32:49.715
Acted?

539
32:50.985 --> 32:53.585
Do you seriously not know me?

540
32:53.655 --> 32:56.085
Of course I do. I'm your bodyguard, and you...

541
32:56.155 --> 32:59.295
No, no. Do you not even watch TV?

542
32:59.355 --> 33:01.765
Do you not know what kind of actor I am?

543
33:02.865 --> 33:04.625
You became an actor?

544
33:04.695 --> 33:07.165
When? Oh, so is it a side hustle?

545
33:07.235 --> 33:08.235
Side hustle?

546
33:09.265 --> 33:11.935
Whatever. You're not my fan,

547
33:12.005 --> 33:15.275
and you're not an extra either. So give me my ring and get lost.

548
33:28.755 --> 33:29.985
Oh, I'm sorry.

549
33:32.995 --> 33:35.625
- You are Um Tae Bong, right? - Yes, I'm Um Tae Bong.

550
33:35.695 --> 33:37.065
If you had hit me,

551
33:37.125 --> 33:39.895
you would have ruined our entire drama.

552
33:39.965 --> 33:41.295
He sure complains a lot.

553
33:45.235 --> 33:47.135
How can a woman be so fearless?

554
33:48.275 --> 33:52.175
I'm fine. Did he just recognize you?

555
33:52.245 --> 33:54.015
Wow, I guess you really are an actor?

556
33:54.075 --> 33:56.445
I'm not fine. A woman protected me.

557
33:56.515 --> 33:58.755
My pride as Um Tae Bong has been crushed.

558
33:58.815 --> 34:01.015
But why do you keep calling yourself Um Tae Bong?

559
34:01.085 --> 34:02.825
That guy from earlier called you that too...

560
34:02.885 --> 34:04.085
Of course.

561
34:04.155 --> 34:07.055
- Because that's my name. - Um Tae Bong?

562
34:09.265 --> 34:11.095
Then are you that...

563
34:11.165 --> 34:13.835
Wait, did you change your name too? When?

564
34:16.405 --> 34:18.735
What? Why are you looking at me like that?

565
34:18.805 --> 34:20.475
Now I am going to crash into that street tree and stop.

566
34:20.535 --> 34:21.845
You trust me, right?

567
34:21.905 --> 34:24.645
Oh, so you hurt your head back then too?

568
34:24.705 --> 34:27.275
And that is why you do not remember me.

569
34:27.345 --> 34:29.515
I asked why you are looking at me like that.

570
34:29.585 --> 34:30.585
Give me my ring back.

571
34:31.915 --> 34:32.915
The ring...

572
34:34.715 --> 34:38.795
I sold it for money. I didn't know it was yours,

573
34:38.855 --> 34:40.395
and I was hungry...

574
34:42.125 --> 34:44.195
Oh, I will get it back tonight.

575
34:44.265 --> 34:45.495
If you just give me the money for it.

576
34:49.265 --> 34:51.775
That guy who got hit by your fan,

577
34:51.835 --> 34:53.805
I heard he is already famous in this industry.

578
34:55.305 --> 34:58.215
You, we have somewhere to go first.

579
35:01.115 --> 35:03.415
Is it you? The one who did this to me?

580
35:03.485 --> 35:05.255
Since it was my fan's mistake,

581
35:05.315 --> 35:07.355
all medical expenses and emotional distress,

582
35:07.415 --> 35:08.855
I will compensate you for everything.

583
35:08.925 --> 35:09.925
Oh, sure.

584
35:11.185 --> 35:12.195
Miss,

585
35:12.255 --> 35:14.655
you should consider it pure luck that Actor Um is paying for you.

586
35:14.725 --> 35:16.225
If you didn't have the money, I would have...

587
35:16.295 --> 35:19.965
- made you pay with your body. - What? With my body?

588
35:20.035 --> 35:22.335
But seeing you in the daylight, you look pretty good.

589
35:22.405 --> 35:23.405
Do you have a boyfriend?

590
35:24.835 --> 35:27.075
Did you hurt your head too, or...

591
35:27.135 --> 35:29.945
- were you always this stupid? - What?

592
35:31.475 --> 35:33.775
You should have known when to quit.

593
35:35.615 --> 35:38.585
I heard you threatened to sue over a minor on-set injury before...

594
35:38.655 --> 35:42.155
and extorted a ton of settlement money from the actors.

595
35:42.225 --> 35:44.685
Me? When? Gosh.

596
35:47.155 --> 35:48.465
I did a little background check...

597
35:49.865 --> 35:52.065
You pulled in 50,000 dollars each time back then.

598
35:52.135 --> 35:54.665
You should either switch your profession to fraud, or...

599
35:56.065 --> 35:58.165
change the body part you injure.

600
35:58.235 --> 36:02.845
Wow, this is all defamation. You, Um Tae Bong, are dead meat.

601
36:02.905 --> 36:05.975
I am going to sue you instead of this woman.

602
36:06.045 --> 36:08.015
Do your best with that too,

603
36:08.075 --> 36:10.415
because there will be no settlement now.

604
36:10.485 --> 36:12.255
Get up, let's go.

605
36:19.795 --> 36:22.065
- Hey, what are you doing? - Actually,

606
36:22.125 --> 36:24.295
there is no one as pitiful as him.

607
36:24.365 --> 36:26.965
He gets blackmailed every day, and if he gets sued on top of that,

608
36:27.035 --> 36:30.335
it is all my fault. So please let it slide just this once. Okay?

609
36:30.405 --> 36:31.605
Please let it slide just this once.

610
36:31.605 --> 36:32.775
- Okay? Please. - Do not grab me. Let go.

611
36:32.775 --> 36:35.745
- It's all my fault, so... - I got it, stop grabbing already.

612
36:35.805 --> 36:36.805
- Please let it slide this once. - Do not grab me.

613
36:36.875 --> 36:37.945
Do not grab me. I said stop grabbing me.

614
36:44.955 --> 36:46.355
Why does this come off so easily?

615
36:57.065 --> 36:58.765
I didn't do it because of this.

616
36:58.835 --> 37:00.765
- In case you misunderstood... - I know.

617
37:06.705 --> 37:08.175
Call me when you find the ring.

618
37:11.645 --> 37:12.645
Gosh.

619
37:14.645 --> 37:15.645
Look here.

620
37:18.015 --> 37:19.015
What did you just do?

621
37:19.085 --> 37:23.585
If not, I will put you on the wanted list that day, got it?

622
37:24.855 --> 37:26.155
Go, go find the ring.

623
37:28.825 --> 37:30.365
Are you not going?

624
37:30.425 --> 37:32.595
I am going.

625
37:39.375 --> 37:40.775
What is her deal?

626
37:42.475 --> 37:44.245
(The Crown Prince's Bodyguard)

627
37:46.575 --> 37:47.975
(Um Tae Bong as Han Jung Woo, Song Na Ri as Cha Hong Du)

628
37:49.385 --> 37:50.745
(Cha Hong Du Character Information,)

629
37:50.815 --> 37:52.855
(Actor Song Na Ri, The Crown Prince's Bodyguard Tns)

630
37:52.915 --> 37:55.385
(Taekwondo Instructor And Private Secret Bodyguard)

631
37:55.455 --> 37:56.555
(Stepmother And Stepsisters Brought By Father)

632
37:56.625 --> 37:57.785
(Father Died in a Car Accident)

633
37:57.855 --> 37:59.555
(Three Women Took Insurance Money and Fled, Hong Du Worked Odd Jobs)

634
38:00.495 --> 38:01.925
Dong Seok,

635
38:01.995 --> 38:04.965
did that woman earlier say her name was Cha Hong Du?

636
38:06.435 --> 38:07.565
Did she?

637
38:07.635 --> 38:10.705
It is the same as the main character in Tae Bong's drama.

638
38:10.765 --> 38:12.305
But why do you ask?

639
38:12.375 --> 38:14.005
That guy Tae Bong.

640
38:14.075 --> 38:16.945
He had quite the colorful past even before he became a celebrity.

641
38:17.945 --> 38:20.145
(Cha Hong Du Character Information)

642
38:22.145 --> 38:23.145
(Great Shop Duty Free)

643
38:23.215 --> 38:24.215
Here too.

644
38:26.085 --> 38:27.085
There too.

645
38:29.955 --> 38:31.085
And over there.

646
38:33.625 --> 38:35.025
His face is everywhere.

647
38:35.095 --> 38:37.095
Did you just hit me? Are you crazy?

648
38:37.095 --> 38:38.835
I'm telling you again,

649
38:38.895 --> 38:42.035
you're not my bodyguard, and I never hired you.

650
38:44.435 --> 38:47.535
What if he keeps failing to remember me?

651
38:47.605 --> 38:50.545
But if he says he does not need a bodyguard,

652
38:50.605 --> 38:52.175
does that mean the threats are gone now?

653
38:53.245 --> 38:56.085
Gosh, who am I worrying about right now?

654
38:56.145 --> 38:57.945
I cannot even remember my friends' names.

655
38:59.355 --> 39:01.215
Darn it.

656
39:01.285 --> 39:03.485
I remember my stepmother and stepsisters' names perfectly.

657
39:03.555 --> 39:04.825
I should have just forgotten about them instead.

658
39:08.125 --> 39:09.795
The weather is nice.

659
39:14.295 --> 39:15.735
What is this?

660
39:15.805 --> 39:19.535
Is that really today's date?

661
39:19.605 --> 39:20.605
(The Crown Prince's Bodyguard)

662
39:20.705 --> 39:24.505
(Broadcast TNS, June 14, 2023, August 17, 2023)

663
39:26.315 --> 39:29.385
This makes no sense. I was in a coma for three years?

664
39:31.315 --> 39:32.915
Wait, then who paid my hospital bills all this time?

665
39:36.025 --> 39:38.185
Did my stepmother hear the news about me?

666
39:38.255 --> 39:41.295
That patient in the single room was bedridden for three years,

667
39:41.355 --> 39:43.965
and she woke up like an absolute miracle.

668
39:44.025 --> 39:45.025
Are they talking about me?

669
39:45.095 --> 39:47.865
But her stepmother or whoever ran off with the settlement money,

670
39:47.935 --> 39:51.235
so the driver probably kept paying her hospital bills.

671
39:51.305 --> 39:54.035
- That patient is so pitiful. - Yes.

672
39:59.175 --> 40:01.475
Oh? That is the patient. Is she here for an outpatient visit?

673
40:02.515 --> 40:05.755
The patient in the VIP room must have gone home too, right?

674
40:08.255 --> 40:10.655
I really have nowhere to go now.

675
40:22.935 --> 40:23.935
Hey.

676
40:25.235 --> 40:26.275
What are you doing here?

677
40:32.015 --> 40:33.915
Oh my.

678
40:36.245 --> 40:38.785
- Oh my. - My gosh.

679
40:40.755 --> 40:41.755
Here it is.

680
40:43.325 --> 40:45.795
I am not giving this to you because I like you,

681
40:45.855 --> 40:48.525
I am making a special exception for you to pay later, you know?

682
40:48.595 --> 40:50.995
Make sure you add the interest to the rent.

683
40:51.065 --> 40:53.535
Yes, I will definitely repay this favor.

684
40:53.595 --> 40:56.635
Right, but what about your household items?

685
40:56.705 --> 40:58.775
Any clothes or dishes you plan to throw away...

686
40:58.835 --> 41:00.335
please throw them all my way.

687
41:00.405 --> 41:03.445
Right, okay, yes.

688
41:05.515 --> 41:07.275
Is this not the house where someone died?

689
41:07.345 --> 41:09.345
- Shut your mouth. - Excuse me?

690
41:09.415 --> 41:12.315
Go on in. Go ahead.

691
41:18.595 --> 41:19.995
Wow.

692
41:28.805 --> 41:31.435
Thanks to Mi Hyang, I even got such nice clothes.

693
41:42.485 --> 41:44.045
It is nice. Let us sign the contract.

694
41:44.115 --> 41:46.485
The handsome young man is quite decisive.

695
41:48.585 --> 41:49.955
But over there...

696
41:50.025 --> 41:52.055
Oh, that one was just taken.

697
41:52.125 --> 41:53.595
By the little rabbit who will repay my favor.

698
41:53.655 --> 41:56.625
There are plenty of better places if you have the money.

699
41:57.965 --> 41:59.165
This place is perfect.

700
41:59.235 --> 42:01.935
Oh my, you even have a beautiful heart.

701
42:09.545 --> 42:11.205
What should we do for the makeup concept?

702
42:11.275 --> 42:13.845
Sexy? Or chic?

703
42:13.915 --> 42:16.945
Today's concept is whatever.

704
42:17.015 --> 42:18.145
- What? - Tae Bong.

705
42:19.585 --> 42:20.785
Which of these outfits are you going to wear?

706
42:20.855 --> 42:23.725
- I don't like any of them. - You didn't even look at them.

707
42:23.785 --> 42:25.255
Still, you have to match it with your makeup.

708
42:25.325 --> 42:26.655
Then today's dress code is also...

709
42:27.795 --> 42:28.795
Whatever.

710
42:33.635 --> 42:38.305
Tae Bong, it's the jewelry launch with main model Song Na Ri, right?

711
42:38.365 --> 42:40.335
- She is your girlfriend, after all. - Exactly...

712
42:41.635 --> 42:44.975
Make me look terrible. So she doesn't get overshadowed.

713
42:45.045 --> 42:47.445
Actually, it would be better if I just don't go.

714
42:47.515 --> 42:50.415
Hey, Su Dong, call them and say I'm not going.

715
42:50.485 --> 42:51.955
He is everyone's sweetheart,

716
42:52.015 --> 42:54.915
but for today, he is Song Na Ri's sweetheart.

717
42:54.985 --> 42:56.885
Right now, the global star Um Tae Bong...

718
42:56.955 --> 42:59.455
is gracing our event with his presence.

719
43:00.725 --> 43:03.995
What a two-faced psychopath.

720
43:04.065 --> 43:06.965
Still, he manages to make a basic suit...

721
43:07.035 --> 43:08.095
look incredibly sexy.

722
43:13.775 --> 43:16.245
Um Tae Bong stole all the cameras from you.

723
43:16.305 --> 43:17.645
Do you see the sponsor over there?

724
43:17.705 --> 43:19.515
Let's do a good job so we can secure the next contract too.

725
43:19.575 --> 43:23.045
Don't worry, I'm Song Na Ri.

726
43:23.115 --> 43:25.715
Um Tae Bong, if you don't mind,

727
43:25.785 --> 43:29.355
could we get a couple pose with Na Ri?

728
44:07.595 --> 44:09.465
Why are they having a lovers' quarrel here?

729
44:13.435 --> 44:14.435
Actor Um Tae Bong.

730
44:17.005 --> 44:20.035
I would like to offer you the position of our male jewelry model.

731
44:20.105 --> 44:21.735
Oh my goodness, that's wonderful.

732
44:21.805 --> 44:24.275
Does that mean we'll be a couple model?

733
44:24.345 --> 44:26.575
Well, that doesn't sound bad.

734
44:26.645 --> 44:28.785
Okay, then we'll proceed with the contract tomorrow,

735
44:28.845 --> 44:30.945
and I have a gift for you before that.

736
44:40.795 --> 44:43.895
But you absolutely cannot wear any other rings.

737
44:45.095 --> 44:48.335
A model has to do what the sponsor tells them to do.

738
44:48.395 --> 44:51.265
Otherwise, it gets on my nerves.

739
44:51.335 --> 44:52.335
Right?

740
44:54.175 --> 44:55.175
Of course.

741
44:58.345 --> 44:59.515
About that modeling offer,

742
45:00.545 --> 45:03.815
I considered it for a moment, but I don't think I can do it.

743
45:03.885 --> 45:07.155
I have a bit of an allergy.

744
45:07.215 --> 45:09.355
- An allergy? - I'm not aware of that.

745
45:16.295 --> 45:20.995
An allergy to obnoxious people. I'm a pretty severe case,

746
45:21.065 --> 45:22.165
so I wonder if you'll be okay with that?

747
45:27.375 --> 45:30.545
Oh, by the way, this has been bothering me for a while.

748
45:37.215 --> 45:38.345
It's so tacky.

749
45:42.455 --> 45:45.085
- Hey. - Let's go.

750
45:45.155 --> 45:46.725
Please make sure to tell them we're sorry.

751
45:46.795 --> 45:48.655
- Hey. - Sir.

752
46:00.105 --> 46:03.405
Did you cry? Are you an actor? Or...

753
46:03.475 --> 46:05.245
are you a commercial model pretending to be an actor?

754
46:06.945 --> 46:09.385
If you consider yourself an actor,

755
46:09.445 --> 46:12.385
never grovel to a sponsor.

756
46:12.455 --> 46:14.215
The only people we should ever grovel to...

757
46:15.385 --> 46:17.055
are the viewers.

758
46:18.895 --> 46:21.295
You can beg them to love your acting...

759
46:22.465 --> 46:25.095
and to give you their affection.

760
46:25.165 --> 46:29.205
And we lose our pride if we live off a sponsor's money.

761
46:29.265 --> 46:32.905
Living off the viewers' affection is what makes us look good.

762
46:32.975 --> 46:34.675
Make your choice.

763
46:34.735 --> 46:35.745
Pride?

764
46:37.305 --> 46:38.305
Or money?

765
46:40.475 --> 46:41.475
Pride.

766
46:44.445 --> 46:48.015
If that is how you think, you can afford to show off a little.

767
46:56.095 --> 46:58.265
What now? What did that jerk do?

768
46:59.535 --> 47:01.995
Jang Hoon, let us show off a little too.

769
47:02.065 --> 47:03.065
What?

770
47:03.135 --> 47:05.335
The commercial extension? I am going to cancel it.

771
47:05.405 --> 47:08.275
The way that CEO looked at me was very unpleasant.

772
47:12.615 --> 47:16.915
Song Na Ri's commercial completely fell through earlier.

773
47:16.985 --> 47:18.145
What should we do?

774
47:18.215 --> 47:20.385
If Song Na Ri loses the commercial because of this,

775
47:21.785 --> 47:23.155
should I say I will do it again?

776
47:23.225 --> 47:24.225
For real?

777
47:26.455 --> 47:28.395
Tell them I will renew the mosquito repellent commercial...

778
47:28.455 --> 47:30.495
without raising my appearance fee.

779
47:30.565 --> 47:34.535
But on the condition that Song Na Ri co-stars with me.

780
47:34.595 --> 47:36.305
I am going to make her wear a mosquito mask.

781
47:36.365 --> 47:37.935
A very, very ugly mask.

782
47:40.835 --> 47:42.745
Oh, I will go get this parking ticket validated.

783
47:42.805 --> 47:45.645
Tae Bong, I need to use the restroom too. Please wait in the car.

784
48:07.065 --> 48:09.135
- Are you okay? - I am not okay at all, darn it.

785
48:10.305 --> 48:11.465
Who was that crazy jerk?

786
48:13.975 --> 48:16.905
No, this...

787
48:16.975 --> 48:21.075
I mean, how many are these?

788
48:21.145 --> 48:23.685
What were you doing while things got this bad, you punk?

789
48:24.745 --> 48:27.385
Oh, I thought these were all fan letters for Tae Bong.

790
48:28.615 --> 48:30.525
I told you to catch the culprit, not scold the kid.

791
48:33.355 --> 48:36.265
Hey, Tae Bong, this method is old-fashioned.

792
48:36.325 --> 48:38.165
Who writes handwritten letters to celebrities these days?

793
48:38.225 --> 48:39.865
Our company deletes all the malicious comments...

794
48:39.935 --> 48:41.865
on Tae Bong's Instagram.

795
48:43.365 --> 48:45.335
Since it is obvious direct messages would be blocked too,

796
48:45.405 --> 48:47.205
this must have been their only other option.

797
48:47.275 --> 48:50.575
Man, this is so chaotic. All right, everyone leave.

798
48:51.805 --> 48:52.815
What...

799
48:54.145 --> 48:55.145
Tae Bong.

800
48:59.055 --> 49:00.155
Sir.

801
49:00.755 --> 49:02.455
Should we not at least get Tae Bong a bodyguard?

802
49:03.825 --> 49:05.555
He never listens to a word I say.

803
49:08.655 --> 49:12.335
Hey, why do you not take the job, Dong Seok?

804
49:12.395 --> 49:15.065
I mean, hey, where do you even...

805
49:15.135 --> 49:17.665
buy something like this?

806
49:17.735 --> 49:20.675
Oh my. Why? Do you not want to?

807
49:21.675 --> 49:22.675
Oh, boy.

808
49:31.285 --> 49:32.655
Did you drop some money on the ground?

809
49:42.865 --> 49:44.225
Is there no interest?

810
49:44.295 --> 49:46.835
Wow, that was really wicked for a second.

811
49:49.635 --> 49:51.105
Do you not wear a ring?

812
49:51.165 --> 49:52.165
Someone told me it's not mine.

813
49:53.535 --> 49:55.075
So you do not have a boyfriend.

814
49:56.145 --> 49:58.905
And what is the name of this person with no boyfriend?

815
49:58.975 --> 50:02.315
- Cha Hong Du. - Cha Hong Du...

816
50:02.385 --> 50:03.715
I am Han Jung Woo.

817
50:03.785 --> 50:04.885
What?

818
50:04.945 --> 50:06.955
My employer's name is also Han Jung Woo.

819
50:07.015 --> 50:08.015
That is a funny coincidence.

820
50:08.085 --> 50:10.725
It is confusing if you have the same name.

821
50:10.785 --> 50:12.055
Then call me Mr. Han.

822
50:12.125 --> 50:15.625
Because names like Mr. Park and Mr. Kim are familiar in Korea.

823
50:15.695 --> 50:16.695
Right.

824
50:17.725 --> 50:19.735
I suppose so, Mr. Han.

825
50:23.735 --> 50:26.675
But the Han Jung Woo I know goes by a different name now.

826
50:26.735 --> 50:30.445
While I was asleep for three years, he changed his name...

827
50:30.505 --> 50:32.415
and completely forgot I even existed.

828
50:33.515 --> 50:34.615
But is he handsome?

829
50:36.215 --> 50:37.215
What?

830
50:37.285 --> 50:40.285
People named Jung Woo...

831
50:40.355 --> 50:41.515
usually have sexy faces.

832
50:46.725 --> 50:47.895
You

833
50:49.195 --> 50:53.495
have a slightly...

834
50:55.195 --> 50:56.935
bigger face.

835
50:57.005 --> 50:58.665
What?

836
50:58.735 --> 51:01.635
Oh, no, it is not. My face is not big.

837
51:01.705 --> 51:03.205
I am completely average.

838
51:03.275 --> 51:05.505
And that is by international standards.

839
51:05.575 --> 51:08.315
It is not big. Come on.

840
51:08.375 --> 51:11.245
So, that guy with a slightly smaller face than me...

841
51:11.315 --> 51:13.515
Did you make up with your employer?

842
51:14.815 --> 51:17.155
No, I was completely fired.

843
51:18.525 --> 51:20.555
Oh, right. Let me borrow your phone for a second.

844
51:21.925 --> 51:24.525
Telling me to come and go when she is the one in debt.

845
51:24.595 --> 51:26.735
If there is even a scratch on that ring, she is dead.

846
51:28.695 --> 51:31.335
But where is she waiting?

847
51:31.405 --> 51:32.935
Oh, there she is.

848
51:34.035 --> 51:35.075
Where should I park?

849
51:49.255 --> 51:52.155
Darn it. If we search you and find money, you are dead.

850
51:54.325 --> 51:59.265
I am feeling very...

851
51:59.335 --> 52:01.095
- depressed today. - That scared me.

852
52:01.165 --> 52:04.935
I protected every inch of this one jerk,

853
52:05.005 --> 52:06.475
but he does not even remember me.

854
52:06.535 --> 52:09.505
So I want to beat the crap out of him like this,

855
52:09.575 --> 52:11.275
but I cannot. Why?

856
52:11.345 --> 52:14.475
Because I was asleep for three whole years.

857
52:14.545 --> 52:17.145
So, kids, just leave while I am asking nicely.

858
52:17.215 --> 52:18.815
Wow, she talks way too much.

859
52:19.855 --> 52:22.785
Oh, I swear, these kids...

860
52:22.855 --> 52:25.225
Words are not going to work on you.

861
52:25.285 --> 52:27.055
- Bring it on. - Come on.

862
52:27.125 --> 52:28.725
- Bring it on. - What should we do?

863
52:28.795 --> 52:30.825
Are you done?

864
52:30.895 --> 52:32.795
Darn it.

865
52:32.865 --> 52:34.235
Oh, my.

866
52:34.295 --> 52:36.905
- Oh, my. - What do we do?

867
52:36.965 --> 52:38.135
Man, this is weird.

868
52:38.205 --> 52:40.675
- I am definitely good at fighting. - Search her.

869
52:40.735 --> 52:42.805
She definitely went this way.

870
52:42.875 --> 52:44.345
- I will not hurt you. - Hurry up and look.

871
52:44.405 --> 52:45.405
I told you to stay still.

872
52:45.475 --> 52:47.645
Hey, it will be over faster if you stay still.

873
52:47.715 --> 52:51.045
Oh, seriously. Where is it? Hey, where is it?

874
52:51.115 --> 52:53.985
Oh, seriously, where is it?

875
52:55.255 --> 52:56.255
That is...

876
52:57.755 --> 52:58.755
You are running away?

877
52:59.895 --> 53:00.895
Then that woman is...

878
53:00.955 --> 53:03.195
- I said let go. - I said let go.

879
53:03.265 --> 53:05.395
What are you going to do if I do not?

880
53:05.465 --> 53:07.635
Get your hands off her right now.

881
53:07.695 --> 53:08.965
Whoa, you scared me.

882
53:13.805 --> 53:15.635
Hey, hold this.

883
53:15.705 --> 53:18.805
What is with that action mask? Are you a pervert?

884
53:18.875 --> 53:21.175
- He looks like a crazy guy. - Crazy guy.

885
53:21.245 --> 53:23.485
I am a man who cannot reveal his identity...

886
53:24.685 --> 53:26.455
due to personal reasons.

887
53:26.515 --> 53:28.115
Are you okay?

888
53:28.185 --> 53:29.955
Mister, just go.

889
53:30.025 --> 53:31.985
What, are you her bodyguard or something?

890
53:32.055 --> 53:35.455
No, she is my bodyguard.

891
53:35.525 --> 53:37.165
It is nice to see you again.

892
53:37.225 --> 53:38.795
- Robin Hood. - I told you he is crazy.

893
53:38.865 --> 53:42.735
Hey, do not step in. I can take them all on anyway.

894
53:44.535 --> 53:47.075
- What is she talking about? - Man, they are crazy.

895
53:55.315 --> 53:57.485
Hey, hey, are you okay? Are you okay? Hey, are you okay?

896
53:57.545 --> 53:59.985
Bong Sik, what should we do? Hey, come here quickly, hurry.

897
54:11.765 --> 54:13.565
- Hey, what are you doing? - Hey, look at her.

898
54:13.635 --> 54:15.665
- What are you doing? - Seriously, what is she doing?

899
54:15.735 --> 54:16.735
Move.

900
54:17.835 --> 54:20.535
- You little brats. - What is wrong with him?

901
54:20.605 --> 54:22.845
- What is wrong with him? - Get up.

902
54:26.975 --> 54:29.615
Why can I not fight? I asked why I cannot. Why?

903
54:29.685 --> 54:32.815
- Oh my. - Is that Um Tae Bong?

904
54:32.885 --> 54:36.625
What? Why are you coming out of there?

905
54:37.625 --> 54:38.725
Wow, this is crazy.

906
54:38.785 --> 54:40.725
How much would we get if we sold this to Distouch?

907
54:40.795 --> 54:42.455
Hey, hey, we are going to make a lot of money.

908
54:42.525 --> 54:43.725
- Tae Bong, look here once. - No photos.

909
54:43.795 --> 54:45.165
Tae Bong, Tae Bong, please look here just once.

910
54:45.225 --> 54:47.465
Tae Bong, Tae Bong, give me your number. Tae Bong.

911
54:47.535 --> 54:48.765
- Tae Bong. - Tae Bong.

912
54:52.265 --> 54:53.435
But...

913
54:53.505 --> 54:56.005
how long is Um Tae Bong going to refuse kiss scenes?

914
54:58.175 --> 54:59.515
Is it the agency's strategy as expected?

915
55:03.185 --> 55:04.445
It is a secret between us.

916
55:05.445 --> 55:07.685
CEO Park, you are smart.

917
55:07.755 --> 55:10.055
Thanks to that, he did get an unrivaled image.

918
55:11.255 --> 55:15.125
A man you want more because you cannot have him easily.

919
55:15.195 --> 55:18.465
- That is exactly our Tae Bong. - But...

920
55:18.525 --> 55:20.495
What if it is not a strategy,

921
55:20.565 --> 55:22.395
but because he has a reason he wants to hide?

922
55:25.105 --> 55:26.875
Then the story might change.

923
55:29.545 --> 55:33.215
Honestly, even if he never shoots a kiss scene for his whole life,

924
55:33.275 --> 55:34.575
why would I hide it like it is a big deal?

925
55:34.645 --> 55:35.645
Well.

926
55:37.045 --> 55:39.885
A guy who can do it but does not,

927
55:39.955 --> 55:42.685
and a guy who lied from the beginning to hide that he cannot,

928
55:44.055 --> 55:45.925
the punishment is different from the start.

929
55:45.985 --> 55:49.595
In showbiz, deceiving the public has no statute of limitations,

930
55:49.665 --> 55:50.725
and you know that well.

931
55:52.765 --> 55:54.395
Oh my.

932
55:54.465 --> 55:56.735
I guess I drank too much.

933
55:56.805 --> 55:57.805
I need to use the restroom.

934
56:09.345 --> 56:10.945
Darn it.

935
56:11.015 --> 56:12.785
This is all because of you.

936
56:12.855 --> 56:15.385
Just because some pictures were taken,

937
56:15.455 --> 56:18.185
- you are making a big fuss. - Your face was in them.

938
56:19.925 --> 56:21.625
If my extreme fans recognize your face,

939
56:21.695 --> 56:23.425
from that day on, your private life is over.

940
56:23.495 --> 56:24.495
Your information will be leaked,

941
56:24.565 --> 56:26.195
and they will come to where you live every day.

942
56:27.965 --> 56:28.995
Not you...

943
56:30.005 --> 56:31.005
Because of me?

944
56:33.235 --> 56:35.235
Well, why did you help me earlier?

945
56:35.305 --> 56:36.305
You...

946
56:37.505 --> 56:38.545
Because you are that Robin Hood.

947
56:39.815 --> 56:41.475
That day I mistook you for a thief...

948
56:43.845 --> 56:44.845
Do you not remember?

949
56:47.285 --> 56:50.755
Anyway, I paid off all my debt.

950
56:50.825 --> 56:52.685
What are you talking about?

951
56:54.195 --> 56:56.495
I am saying this in case you misunderstand...

952
56:56.565 --> 56:57.965
those kids earlier,

953
56:58.025 --> 57:00.995
I actually went easy on them, you know?

954
57:01.065 --> 57:02.665
Whatever.

955
57:04.765 --> 57:08.075
- Give me my ring. - What? Did you just litter?

956
57:13.445 --> 57:15.375
It smells like fried chicken.

957
57:16.415 --> 57:17.945
That smells delicious.

958
57:18.015 --> 57:19.815
Did you not hear me ask for my ring?

959
57:21.855 --> 57:22.855
Darn it.

960
57:25.855 --> 57:26.855
Yes.

961
57:26.925 --> 57:29.725
Hey, I am meeting with a reporter right now.

962
57:29.795 --> 57:30.895
What should we do, Tae Bong?

963
57:32.165 --> 57:33.335
Why?

964
57:33.395 --> 57:37.765
I think she caught wind of your fatal flaw.

965
57:37.835 --> 57:38.835
Do not tell me...

966
57:39.935 --> 57:43.145
Did she find out about my flaw?

967
57:43.205 --> 57:44.375
Flaw?

968
57:44.445 --> 57:46.045
- What is that? - Who is that next to you?

969
57:46.105 --> 57:48.315
- How long have you been listening? - Is that a woman's voice?

970
57:48.375 --> 57:49.375
Gosh.

971
57:50.515 --> 57:51.745
It is nothing.

972
57:51.815 --> 57:52.885
Anyway,

973
57:52.955 --> 57:55.755
your secret is going to send me to an early grave.

974
57:55.815 --> 57:57.555
It has to remain a secret...

975
57:57.625 --> 57:59.925
from the reporters until the end.

976
58:04.065 --> 58:07.135
- What exactly is this flaw? - You do not need to know.

977
58:07.195 --> 58:09.435
- Give me my ring. - What?

978
58:09.495 --> 58:11.535
Now I am even more curious since you will not tell me.

979
58:16.605 --> 58:17.645
Tell me, and I will give it to you.

980
58:19.245 --> 58:20.845
Give it.

981
58:20.915 --> 58:21.945
Hurry up and give it to me.

982
58:23.185 --> 58:24.215
Stop messing around.

983
58:34.425 --> 58:36.665
What? Hey, are you choking?

984
58:36.725 --> 58:38.365
Open your mouth. Open wide.

985
58:39.695 --> 58:41.835
Spit it out.

986
58:41.895 --> 58:45.265
Spit it out, I said. Darn it.

987
58:45.335 --> 58:46.705
Here we go. One, two, three.

988
58:48.005 --> 58:49.005
One, two.

989
58:50.275 --> 58:52.675
Come on, get out of there.

990
58:55.015 --> 58:57.215
What? Hey.

991
58:58.415 --> 58:59.415
Oh my.

992
59:01.455 --> 59:03.025
Oh, what a relief.

993
59:03.085 --> 59:04.085
Hey, I found...

994
59:05.685 --> 59:06.695
Hey.

995
59:08.625 --> 59:11.065
Hey, what is wrong with you? Oh, wait.

996
59:14.835 --> 59:16.435
Wait a minute, what do I do?

997
59:22.135 --> 59:23.145
Darn it.

998
59:44.265 --> 59:46.765
Hi there, kid. Do you want to play together?

999
59:56.775 --> 59:57.775
Hey.

1000
01:00:01.815 --> 01:00:03.285
Snap out of it, hey.

1001
01:00:03.345 --> 01:00:06.585
It has to remain a secret from the reporters until the end.

1002
01:00:08.055 --> 01:00:09.725
Do not tell me...

1003
01:00:09.785 --> 01:00:11.655
Your secret is...

1004
01:00:11.725 --> 01:00:15.455
Um Tae Bong never films kissing scenes, you know.

1005
01:00:15.525 --> 01:00:17.625
But why?

1006
01:00:17.695 --> 01:00:22.395
That is right, this is the fatal flaw that Sexy Trash has.

1007
01:00:22.465 --> 01:00:25.805
That I cannot breathe whenever I kiss someone.

1008
01:00:25.865 --> 01:00:28.335
That I cannot act like nothing happened...

1009
01:00:28.405 --> 01:00:30.975
and just breathe normally.

1010
01:00:31.045 --> 01:00:33.645
Because I think of that child every time.

1011
01:00:35.075 --> 01:00:36.075
So...

1012
01:00:37.215 --> 01:00:38.915
It drives me crazy that I am alive.

1013
01:00:44.055 --> 01:00:46.995
(Oh! My Guard)
